# skills: Savage Rush (Gabryel, level 1, 5 MP): she runs in, winds up, and swipes twice with her unused
# double claw (btldata 33), an ordinary hit on each swipe. Gabryel alone at level 1 (level index 0 pinned,
# battle MP pinned to 50), first temple battle, the battle's sure-hit flag (Focus, bit 4 of the battle
# work's first word) pinned so neither swipe misses. Round 1: Down on the list (Gale Cut, Savage Rush;
# shot sr_list), A, grid Down to battler 9 in the front row (sr_grid), A: shots sr_a00 on, MP 50 -> 45
# and hp9 drops twice. Round 2: the same with grid Right, a back-row enemy (her leap; shots sr_b00 on).
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: HP +0x14, MP +0x18). Run with --save.
include party_gabryel
pin u32 0x020B471C 0
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
pinptr u32 0x020B8550 0x0 4
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e878 gabryel_mp
watch u32 0x0228ea24 hp4
watch u32 0x0228ea90 hp5
watch u32 0x0228eafc hp6
watch u32 0x0228ebd4 hp8
watch u32 0x0228ec40 hp9
watch u32 0x0228ecac hp10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 50
shot sr_list
press A 8
wait 80
press Down 8
wait 30
shot sr_grid
